usage: cix_rust_hotspot_audit.py [-h] {prepare,run} ...

Prepare and, only after an explicit qualified-release freeze, run CIX hotspot
profiles. ``prepare`` is deliberately non-executing. It binds one existing CCA
plan row, an immutable native release and CPU 8 (P) / CPU 16 (E) command
vectors. ``run`` requires both ``--execute`` and a reviewed qualified-release
freeze plus a scheduler lease receipt; it never creates an independent worker
pool.

positional arguments:
  {prepare,run}
    prepare      bind immutable release/input and write commands only
    run          guarded future execution

options:
  -h, --help     show this help message and exit
